						    <p>Matong Energy Limited is committed to protecting your privacy and developing technology that gives you the most powerful and safe online experience. This Statement of Privacy applies to the Matong Energy Limited Web site and governs data collection and usage. By using the Matong Energy Limited website, you consent to the data practices described in this statement.</p>
                            <h5>COLLECTION OF YOUR PERSONAL INFORMATION</h5>
						    <p>Matong Energy Limited collects personally identifiable information, such as your e-mail address, name, home or work address or telephone number. Matong Energy Limited also collects anonymous demographic information, which is not unique to you, such as your ZIP code, age, gender, preferences, interests and favorites.</p>
