						    <h5>USE OF YOUR PERSONAL INFORMATION</h5>
						    <p>Matong Energy Limited collects and uses your personal information to operate the Matong Energy Limited Web site and deliver the services you have requested. Matong Energy Limited also uses your personally identifiable information to inform you of other products or services available from Matong Energy Limited and its affiliates. Matong Energy Limited may also contact you via surveys to conduct research about your opinion of current services or of potential new services that may be offered.</p>
						    <p>Matong Energy Limited does not sell, rent or lease its customer lists to third parties. Matong Energy Limited may, from time to time, contact you on behalf of external business partners about a particular offering that may be of interest to you. In those cases, your unique personally identifiable information (e-mail, name, address, telephone number) is not transferred to the third party. In addition, Matong Energy Limited may share data with trusted partners to help us perform statistical analysis, send you email or postal mail, provide customer support, or arrange for deliveries. All such third parties are prohibited from using your personal information except to provide these services to Matong Energy Limited, and they are required to maintain the confidentiality of your information.</p>
						    <p>Matong Energy Limited does not use or disclose sensitive personal information, such as race, religion, or political affiliations, without your explicit consent.</p>
						    <p>Matong Energy Limited keeps track of the Web sites and pages our customers visit within Matong Energy Limited, in order to determine what Matong Energy Limited services are the most popular. This data is used to deliver customized content and advertising within Matong Energy Limited to customers whose behavior indicates that they are interested in a particular subject area.</p>
